OCPARTICLE 2
NAME Fire and Smoke
# Wave 10 demo: three emitters in one system. Flames (additive) die into Smoke (alpha-blended, ambient-lit, sorted back to
# front) through an ONEVENT death rule, and a few sparks fly off with their own gravity. Flames and Sparks are their own light.
# Intensity (a user parameter a script can set) is the flames' curl-noise strength: how violently they lick.
PARAM Intensity float 40
EMITTER Flames
SIM auto
SHAPE disc 25
BLEND additive
EMISSION 320 0 3000
LIFETIME 0.7 1.2
DIRECTION 0 0 1 12
SPEED 60 140
GRAVITY 0 0 80
DAMPING 0.5
SIZE 22 6
COLORCURVE 0 1 0.75 0.3 0.8 0.35 1 0.4 0.08 0.6 1 0.35 0.05 0.02 0
SPRITE camera
SORT none
LIGHTING unlit
FOG on
BOUNDS 600
MODULE spawn.sizescale min=0.7 max=1.3
MODULE update.curlnoise freq=0.02 strength=@Intensity scroll=0.8 octaves=2 seed=3
ONEVENT death SPAWN Smoke 1
EMITTER Smoke
SIM auto
SHAPE point 0 0 0
BLEND alphablend
EMISSION 0 0 2500
LIFETIME 3 5
DIRECTION 0 0 1 25
SPEED 30 70
GRAVITY 0 0 35
DAMPING 0.35
SIZE 30 110
COLORCURVE 0 0.18 0.17 0.16 0 0.2 0.2 0.19 0.18 0.35 0.8 0.28 0.28 0.28 0.18 1 0.3 0.3 0.3 0
SPRITE camera
SORT depth
LIGHTING ambient
FOG on
GI on
BOUNDS 1500
MODULE spawn.sizescale min=0.8 max=1.4
MODULE spawn.rotation minDeg=0 maxDeg=360 spinMin=-25 spinMax=25
MODULE update.curlnoise freq=0.008 strength=60 scroll=0.2 octaves=3 seed=11
EMITTER Sparks
SIM auto
SHAPE sphere 12
BLEND additive
EMISSION 30 0 2048
LIFETIME 0.8 1.6
DIRECTION 0 0 1 55
SPEED 220 420
GRAVITY 0 0 -700
DAMPING 0.05
SIZE 2 0.5
COLOR start 1 0.8 0.35 1
COLOR end 1 0.25 0.05 0
SPRITE velocity stretch 0.5
SORT none
LIGHTING unlit
FOG on
BOUNDS 700
